{"seq":1,"slug":"btree-indexes","title":"B 树与 B+ 树索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-indexing/structures/btree-indexes","wordCount":1576,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"b-树与-b-树索引\">B 树与 B+ 树索引</h1><p>如果只能记住一种索引结构，那一定是 B+ 树。打开任意一个主流关系型数据库——MySQL 的 InnoDB、PostgreSQL、SQL Server、Oracle——你建的索引在不特别指定类型时，几乎都是 B+ 树。它能在同一棵树上同时高效支撑等值查询和范围查询，又能保持稳定的对数级查找代价，还对磁盘 I/O 友好。理解它的内部构造，就解锁了上一章 <a href=\"../foundations/access-paths\">访问路径</a> 里大半访问路径背后的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>B+ 树之所以成为关系库的默认索引，源于三个设计决定的叠加：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>换来什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多路</td>\n<td>每个节点存几百个键、对应一个磁盘页</td>\n<td>树矮胖，磁盘 I/O 次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_b N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平衡</td>\n<td>分裂/合并保持所有叶子同层</td>\n<td>最坏情况也是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_b N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据下压</td>\n<td>只有叶子存数据，叶子用链表相连</td>\n<td>范围查询沿链表顺序扫，极快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多路</strong>针对的是磁盘：二叉树的 27 层是 27 次随机 I/O，多路把它压到三四层。</li>\n<li><strong>平衡</strong>消除了退化风险，避免有序性被破坏后退化成链表。</li>\n<li><strong>数据下压 + 叶子链表</strong>是 B+ 树相对 B 树的关键改良，是范围扫描访问路径的物理基础，代价则是每次写入都要维护有序性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是-多路平衡树\">为什么是「多路平衡树」</h2><p>二叉搜索树查找是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_2 N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，看起来够快了，为什么数据库不用它？因为磁盘。二叉树每个节点只有两个分支，树会很「高」——一亿个键的二叉树有约 27 层，查一次最坏要 27 次磁盘 I/O。而磁盘 I/O 是索引的真正瓶颈（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-index\">索引为何存在</a>）。</p>\n<p>B 树的破局点在于「多路」：让每个节点存很多个键、有很多个分支（扇出，fan-out）。一个节点正好对应一个磁盘页（如 16KB），里面塞下几百个键。扇出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，树越「矮胖」，查找的磁盘访问次数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = \\log_b N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\approx 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h \\approx 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>。也就是说一亿个键，树只有三四层，查一次只读三四个页。同时 B 树通过节点的分裂与合并始终保持「平衡」——所有叶子在同一层，保证最坏情况也是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_b N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，不会退化成链表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"b-树与-b-树的关键差异\">B 树与 B+ 树的关键差异</h2><p>人们口头说「B 树索引」，实际数据库用的几乎都是它的改良版 B+ 树。两者的区别虽小，对数据库却至关重要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>B 树</th>\n<th>B+ 树</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据存放位置</td>\n<td>内部节点和叶子都存数据</td>\n<td>只有叶子存数据，内部节点只存键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶子之间</td>\n<td>无连接</td>\n<td>叶子用链表横向串起来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围查询</td>\n<td>需中序遍历，跳上跳下</td>\n<td>沿叶子链表顺序扫，极快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部节点扇出</td>\n<td>较小（要分空间给数据）</td>\n<td>更大（只存键，更多分支）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>B+ 树的两个改良——数据全压在叶子层、叶子之间用链表相连——直接成就了它处理范围查询的能力。<code>WHERE age BETWEEN 20 AND 30</code> 时，只要定位到 20 所在的叶子，然后顺着叶子链表一路扫到 30 即可，这就是上一章「索引范围扫描」访问路径的物理实现。哈希索引恰恰因为没有这种有序结构，无法支持范围查询（对比见 <a href=\"hash-bitmap-indexes\">哈希索引与位图索引</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[根节点&lt;br/&gt;[50 | 100]&quot;] --&gt; A[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;[20 | 35]&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; B[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;[70 | 85]&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; C[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;[120 | 160]&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; L1[&quot;叶子&lt;br/&gt;10,15,18&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; L2[&quot;叶子&lt;br/&gt;22,30&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; L3[&quot;叶子&lt;br/&gt;35,40,48&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; L4[&quot;叶子&lt;br/&gt;55,68&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; L5[&quot;叶子&lt;br/&gt;72,80&quot;]&#10;    L1 -.链表.-&gt; L2&#10;    L2 -.链表.-&gt; L3&#10;    L3 -.链表.-&gt; L4&#10;    L4 -.链表.-&gt; L5\">graph TD\n    R[根节点&lt;br/&gt;[50 | 100]\"] --&gt; A[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;[20 | 35]\"]\n    R --&gt; B[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;[70 | 85]\"]\n    R --&gt; C[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;[120 | 160]\"]\n    A --&gt; L1[\"叶子&lt;br/&gt;10,15,18\"]\n    A --&gt; L2[\"叶子&lt;br/&gt;22,30\"]\n    A --&gt; L3[\"叶子&lt;br/&gt;35,40,48\"]\n    B --&gt; L4[\"叶子&lt;br/&gt;55,68\"]\n    B --&gt; L5[\"叶子&lt;br/&gt;72,80\"]\n    L1 -.链表.-&gt; L2\n    L2 -.链表.-&gt; L3\n    L3 -.链表.-&gt; L4\n    L4 -.链表.-&gt; L5</pre><h2 id=\"插入-分裂与页面利用率\">插入、分裂与页面利用率</h2><p>B+ 树的有序性不是免费的。每次插入，键都要落到正确的叶子里以维持有序。当一个叶子页塞满时，它会分裂（split）成两个半满的页，并向上层插入一个新的分隔键——这个过程可能层层向上传导，甚至导致根节点分裂、树长高一层。删除则可能触发合并（merge）。</p>\n<p>这带来两个工程后果。其一，随机顺序的插入（比如用 UUID 作主键）会在树的各处引发频繁分裂，造成页面只填了一半、大量空间浪费，这正是 <a href=\"../design/index-maintenance\">索引维护与监控</a> 里「索引膨胀」的成因之一。其二，自增主键的插入总是落在最右侧的叶子，分裂集中且页面填充率高——这就是为什么 InnoDB 强烈推荐用自增整数而非 UUID 做主键。每次写入都要维护这棵树，也正是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-index\">索引为何存在</a> 里「写入惩罚」的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的新进展-postgresql-18-跳跃扫描\">2026 年的新进展：PostgreSQL 18 跳跃扫描</h2><p>B+ 树的一条经典限制是「最左前缀规则」：复合索引 <code>(a, b)</code> 上，若查询不约束前导列 a 而只约束 b，索引通常用不上（详见 <a href=\"../design/composite-covering\">复合索引与覆盖索引</a>）。2025 年 9 月发布、2026 年广泛应用的 PostgreSQL 18 引入了 B 树跳跃扫描（skip scan），让优化器在前导列基数较低时，自动遍历前导列的每个取值、对每个取值在索引里做一次范围查找，从而绕开最左前缀的硬约束（来源：PostgreSQL 18 官方文档 postgresql.org/docs/current/btree.html；neon.com 关于 PG18 skip scan 的分析）。</p>\n<p>这意味着 <code>(status, created_at)</code> 索引上，即便查询只写 <code>WHERE created_at &gt; &#39;2026-01-01&#39;</code>，只要 status 的取值不多，PG18 也可能用上这个索引。这是 B 树家族近年最受关注的优化之一，但它并不改变「应该把高选择性列放前面」的设计原则，只是为前导列低基数的场景兜了底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>B+ 树是关系型数据库的默认索引结构，靠「多路 + 平衡」把磁盘访问压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_b N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（亿级数据仅三四层）。</li>\n<li>相比 B 树，B+ 树把数据全放叶子、叶子间用链表相连，因此范围查询极快——这是它支撑范围扫描访问路径的物理基础。</li>\n<li>维护有序性靠插入时的分裂和删除时的合并；随机插入（如 UUID 主键）会引发频繁分裂、页面浪费和索引膨胀，自增主键则填充紧凑。</li>\n<li>每次写入都要维护 B+ 树，是索引写入惩罚的直接来源。</li>\n<li>PostgreSQL 18（2025 年发布）的跳跃扫描放宽了最左前缀限制，让低基数前导列的复合索引在缺失前导条件时也能被用上。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"B 树与 B+ 树索引","id":"b-树与-b-树索引"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是「多路平衡树」","id":"为什么是-多路平衡树"},{"level":2,"text":"B 树与 B+ 树的关键差异","id":"b-树与-b-树的关键差异"},{"level":2,"text":"插入、分裂与页面利用率","id":"插入-分裂与页面利用率"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的新进展：PostgreSQL 18 跳跃扫描","id":"2026-年的新进展-postgresql-18-跳跃扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"访问路径与索引使用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-indexing/foundations/access-paths"},"next":{"title":"哈希索引与位图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-indexing/structures/hash-bitmap-indexes"}}